  "alpha_composite_observation": "Inspected actual RGBA composition over the scene and the runtime renderer at large encounter scale. The strong RGB fringe in transparent pixels was not visible as a colored outline in the actual alpha blend. Kept the first flawed-spacing source out of runtime.",
  "crop_observation": "Five separate alpha>=32 regions found. Crops include 14px padding where available; no nontransparent body region touches crop edge. No recolor or alpha erasure applied. Lossless WebP sprites retain alpha.",
  "anchors": "Each sprite uses an independent normalized foot anchor measured from the bottom opaque support region. The logical map uses 17 explicitly mapped dry-land anchors; paths were inspected over the actual background.",
  "path_review": "Map line paths avoid the painted pond and large rocks. The path at logical x=5 was moved right of the central lower rock. Nodes and sprite feet use the same mapping.",
